**Root cause:** `triggers update` requires a source-type subcommand (your trigger is GitHub-backed) — not a bare trigger name as first positional arg.

**Fix:**

```bash
gcloud beta builds triggers update github careernavigator-backend-staging \
  --project=pg-ae-n-app-125609 \
  --region=me-central2 \
  --worker-pool=projects/pg-ae-n-app-125609/locations/me-central2/workerPools/cn-backend-private-pool
```

**Verify:**
```bash
gcloud beta builds triggers export careernavigator-backend-staging \
  --project=pg-ae-n-app-125609 \
  --region=me-central2 \
  --destination=trigger-backend-verify.yaml

cat trigger-backend-verify.yaml
```

